# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback for app.padilearn.com.
#
# Flutter copies everything in web/ into build/web, so this ships with the app.
#
# /payment-callback is a route, not a file. Paystack sends a paying student
# there after checkout; without this rule Cloudflare returns 404 and the
# student is never enrolled even though the money left their account.
#
# 200 (not 301/302) so the browser keeps the original URL and its
# ?reference=... query string, which is what the callback screen reads.
